        "message": {
          "content": "B\n\nLeaving does nothing to alleviate the child's suffering or alter the terms of the city's existence; it only subtracts from the world's total well-being by creating unnecessary hardship and grief for you and those who care about you. Because walking away produces no tangible benefit for the victim and simply results in a net loss of happiness, remaining in the community where thousands of lives flourish is the choice that minimizes needless harm and preserves the greatest overall good.",
